{
  "_comment": [
    "STAGING deploy config for We Stay Fit. Used only by the reviewed",
    "wsf-staging-deploy GitHub Actions workflow, which copies this file into the",
    "checkout of the app commit it deploys.",
    "",
    "It exists because firebase.json is the production default: its hosting has no",
    "site (so it resolves to GoArrive's) and it carries the `default` functions",
    "codebase alongside `westayfit`. Deploying staging through it is the",
    "repository-default shortcut this workflow must never take.",
    "",
    "Only the westayfit codebase is declared here, so `--only functions:westayfit`",
    "cannot reach GoArrive's functions even by mistake. firestore and storage are",
    "deliberately absent: rules and indexes are not part of any WSF deploy.",
    "",
    "hosting mirrors firebase.westayfit.json exactly except for the site. Keep the",
    "two in sync; a rewrite that differs here is a staging build that does not test",
    "what ships.",
    "",
    "gha-creds-*.json appears in both ignore lists because google-github-actions/auth",
    "writes its credentials file into GITHUB_WORKSPACE. Neither upload path should",
    "reach the workspace root, and this makes that structural rather than incidental."
  ],
  "functions": [
    {
      "source": "functions-westayfit",
      "codebase": "westayfit",
      "ignore": [
        "node_modules",
        ".git",
        "firebase-debug.log",
        "firebase-debug.*.log",
        "*.local",
        "gha-creds-*.json"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "hosting": {
    "site": "westayfit-staging",
    "public": "apps/westayfit/dist",
    "ignore": [
      "firebase.json",
      "firebase.westayfit.json",
      "firebase.westayfit.staging.json",
      "gha-creds-*.json",
      "**/.*",
      "**/node_modules/**"
    ],
    "cleanUrls": true,
    "trailingSlash": false,
    "rewrites": [
      { "source": "/community/*/challenge", "destination": "/community/__dynamic/challenge.html" },
      { "source": "/community/*/members", "destination": "/community/__dynamic/members.html" },
      { "source": "/community/**", "destination": "/community/__dynamic.html" },
      { "source": "/join/**", "destination": "/join/__dynamic.html" },
      { "source": "/contribute/**", "destination": "/contribute/__dynamic.html" },
      { "source": "/display/**", "destination": "/display/__dynamic.html" },
      { "source": "/kiosk/**", "destination": "/kiosk/__dynamic.html" },
      { "source": "/station/**", "destination": "/station/__dynamic.html" },
      { "source": "/event/**", "destination": "/event/__dynamic.html" },
      { "source": "/queue/**", "destination": "/queue/__dynamic.html" },
      { "source": "/move/**", "destination": "/move/__dynamic.html" },
      { "source": "/combined/**", "destination": "/combined/__dynamic.html" }
    ],
    "headers": [
      {
        "source": "/**",
        "headers": [
          { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate" },
          { "key": "X-Content-Type-Options", "value": "nosniff" },
          { "key": "X-Robots-Tag", "value": "noindex, nofollow" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source": "/index.html",
        "headers": [
          { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "text/html; charset=utf-8" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source": "/_expo/static/js/**/*.js",
        "headers": [
          { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/javascript; charset=utf-8" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
